    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d765">

                <pb facs="0889" n="793" sameAs="frus:frus1899/pg793"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Russell to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Caracas</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1899-08-07"><hi rendition="#italic">August 7,
                        1899</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 313.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to state that last week
                    the insurgent faction in the State of Los Andes under Gen. Cipriano Castro was
                    completely defeated by the Government troops in a bloody battle which lasted
                    eighteen hours. The loss of the insurgents is placed at 800 killed and wounded
                    and the Government lost 300.</p>
                <p>This is the end of the disturbances in that section, which was the only part
                    where there was trouble.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">William W.
                    Russell.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
